// Normally this file is generated by `flutterfire configure`. We provide it
// by hand here so the project builds end-to-end without the FlutterFire CLI.
//
// NOTE: The Android values mirror the `google-services.json` committed under
// `android/app/`. The `apiKey` below is the public-facing Firebase Android
